Child agent {agent_name} is waiting for an answer to these structured questions:
{questions}
Use answer with the agent_name shown above and one nonblank textual answer for every question in the order shown. Invalid or partial answers leave the request pending.

This turn must not exit while queues owned by this agent contain items.
{queues}
Drain every listed queue before finishing, even when asked to stop. Use queue_take to consume items or coordinate consumers and wait until all owned queues are empty. Closing a queue does not drain it. There is no waiver or abandon action. Parent-owned queues do not block completion; an empty open queue does not block completion.

