WORKDIR is the initial working directory; SCRATCH_DIR is shared within this user session; AGENT_SCRATCH_DIR is this agent's scratch directory; AGENT_HISTORY_DIR contains this agent's history.jsonl.
exec_command supports normal shell expansion, for example "$SCRATCH_DIR/somefile.txt" or "${AGENT_SCRATCH_DIR}/somefile.txt". Quote paths to preserve spaces. Explicit env entries override these defaults for that command only; overriding one variable does not change the others. The read, write and edit path arguments expand "$NAME" and "${NAME}" references to these defaults only; other tools' path arguments do not expand environment variables.

